  itemDescription: "Applied Genomics Technologies Institute  Saudi Human Genome Project 
    This institute leads Saudi Arabia\u2019s efforts in genomics and personalized
    medicine. It focuses on genome sequencing, genetic analysis, and the development
    of applications for diagnosing genetic diseases and tailoring treatments to individuals.
    By leveraging state-of-the-art genome technologies, the institute aims to identify
    genetic risk factors prevalent in the region and contribute to precision medicine
    initiatives such as the Saudi Human Genome Program"
